# Whitelist build context: only what docker/Dockerfile.splatad COPYs.
# Keeps multi-GB data/, the Mac .venv and the local (already patched)
# third_party/ checkout out of the image so the build is from pinned sources.
*
!pyproject.toml
!src/
!tests/
!configs/
!scripts/
!docker/constraints.txt
# tests/unit/test_readonly_guard.py loads this hook by path
!.claude/hooks/readonly_bash_guard.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
